#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x427df9/0x000000
msgid "What about me?"
msgstr "那我呢？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x427df9/0x000001
msgid "Stay put. Ever wonder what it's like to be a bird?"
msgstr "别动。你想过当鸟是什么感觉吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x527db7/0x000000
msgid "Guess you didn't listen. How'd you escape?"
msgstr "看来你没听。怎么逃的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x527db7/0x000001
msgid "I waited for an opening, stole an ID card. "
msgstr "我等到了机会，偷了张ID卡。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x527db7/0x000002
msgid ""
"They almost caught me, \n"
"but I managed to elude them... "
msgstr ""
"他们差点抓到我，\n"
"但我甩掉了他们……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x527db7/0x000003
msgid ""
"You made it this far and then \n"
"succumbed to exhaustion."
msgstr ""
"你撑到了这里，然后\n"
"就累垮了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x527db7/0x000004
msgid "I was barefoot... with no supplies."
msgstr "我光着脚……没补给。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d76/0x000000
msgid "...Hey."
msgstr "……喂。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d76/0x000001
msgid ""
"Ah, tu m'as trouvée ! (You found me!)\n"
"C'est moi le loup ! (Tag! I'm it!)"
msgstr ""
"啊，你找到我了！\n"
"是我，抓到你了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d76/0x000002
msgid "French..."
msgstr "法国的……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d76/0x000003
msgid ""
"Fini de jouer à cache-cache. \n"
"(Enough hide-and-seek.)"
msgstr ""
"捉迷藏结束了。\n"
"（捉迷藏玩够了。）"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d76/0x000004
msgid "Dis-moi qui tu es. (Tell me who you are.)"
msgstr "告诉我你是谁。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d98/0x000000
msgid ""
"They're rare, but they're not covered\n"
"under the Washington Treaty."
msgstr ""
"它们很稀有，但不在\n"
"华盛顿条约的保护范围内。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d98/0x000001
msgid "The Resplendent Quetzal is red-listed."
msgstr "凤尾绿咬鹃是濒危物种。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d98/0x000002
msgid "Really... you know your stuff."
msgstr "真的……你挺懂行。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d98/0x000003
msgid "I am... an ornithologist myself."
msgstr "我……也是鸟类学家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x627d98/0x000004
msgid ""
"Well, we'll have to compare notes later.\n"
"Here, drink some of this."
msgstr ""
"那以后我们得交流交流。\n"
"来，喝点这个。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000000
msgid "Oh, I am so sorry. I drank it all."
msgstr "哦，抱歉。我喝光了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000001
msgid "That facility... Did you see anybody else in there?"
msgstr "那个设施……你在里面见过别人吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000002
msgid ""
"Well, there was another woman.\n"
"But I never saw her in person..."
msgstr ""
"嗯，还有个女人。\n"
"但我没见过她本人……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000003
msgid "Because, you know... the blindfold..."
msgstr "因为，你知道……蒙眼……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000004
msgid "Oh, yes... she often sang..."
msgstr "哦，对……她经常唱歌……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000005
msgid "Sang...?"
msgstr "唱歌……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000006
msgid "It was such a strange song..."
msgstr "那首歌很奇怪……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000007
msgid ""
"What kind of person was she?\n"
"Could you tell anything from her voice?"
msgstr ""
"她是什么样的人？\n"
"能从声音听出什么吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000008
msgid ""
"I don't know. I don't even know \n"
"why I was held prisoner."
msgstr ""
"不知道。我连自己\n"
"为什么被关都不知道。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727dbc/0x000009
msgid ""
"They confiscated my equipment, my supplies,\n"
"my passport, money... everything."
msgstr ""
"他们没收了我的装备、补给、\n"
"护照、钱……所有东西。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000000
msgid "It sounds like heaven."
msgstr "听起来像天堂。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000001
msgid "Close, but not quite. Outer Heaven."
msgstr "差不多，但不完全是。世外天堂。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000002
msgid "It is sounding better all the time."
msgstr "越听越不错了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000003
msgid ""
"So, you must have gotten a look at the facility\n"
"when you escaped, right? "
msgstr ""
"所以，你逃脱的时候一定看过那个设施\n"
"对吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000004
msgid "What's in there?"
msgstr "里面是啥？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000005
msgid ""
"...A lot of machinery. A big computer,\n"
"like you would see in a university..."
msgstr ""
"……很多机器。一台大电脑，\n"
"就像大学里那种……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000006
msgid ""
"What about the room where you heard\n"
"the voice? Anybody in there?"
msgstr ""
"你听到声音的那个房间呢？\n"
"里面有人吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000007
msgid "I don't know. There was a tube..."
msgstr "不知道。有个管子……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000008
msgid "A large tube, in the back..."
msgstr "一个大管子，在后面……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x000009
msgid "When I approached it, I heard a voice."
msgstr "我靠近时听到一个声音。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x00000a
msgid "What did it say?"
msgstr "它说了啥？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0x727ddc/0x00000b
msgid "...\"Jack.\""
msgstr "……“杰克。”"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000000
msgid "Please, do not kill me..."
msgstr "求求你，别杀我……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000001
msgid "You're no soldier... "
msgstr "你不是士兵……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000002
msgid "I am a tourist..."
msgstr "我是游客……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000003
msgid "What's your name?"
msgstr "你叫啥？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000004
msgid "...Please..."
msgstr "……求你了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000005
msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr "你在这里做什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d77/0x000006
msgid "Cécile Cosima Caminades."
msgstr "塞西尔·科西玛·卡米纳德斯。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000000
msgid "Haa... You saved me."
msgstr "哈……你救了我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000001
msgid "They told me this was a paradise... "
msgstr "他们告诉我这里是天堂……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000002
msgid ""
"that there were more rare birds here \n"
"than anywhere else... "
msgstr ""
"这里的稀有鸟类比其他任何地方\n"
"都要多……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000003
msgid "that there was no war here... that it was safe..."
msgstr "说这里没有战争……很安全……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000004
msgid ""
"They told me it was every birder's dream.\n"
"But... they were wrong."
msgstr ""
"他们说这是每个观鸟者的梦想。\n"
"但……他们错了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000005
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr "怎么了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000006
msgid "...If only I had not recorded that stupid voice..."
msgstr "……要是我没录那蠢声音就好了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27d9a/0x000007
msgid "...Voice?"
msgstr "……声音？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000000
msgid "Yes, it simply said \"Jack,\" over and over."
msgstr "对，它不停说“杰克”。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000001
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000063
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000064
msgid "Jack..."
msgstr "杰克……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000002
msgid ""
"...Listen, you've got to get me out of here.\n"
"I really need a shower!"
msgstr ""
"……听着，你得把我弄出去。\n"
"我真得洗个澡了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000003
msgid "Wait here. I've still got business to take care of."
msgstr "在这等着。我还有事要处理。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000004
msgid ""
"What? You're not thinking of going in there,\n"
"are you? You can't leave me here!"
msgstr ""
"什么？你不是想进那里去吧？\n"
"你不能把我丢在这！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000005
msgid "Relax. I'll have some friends pick you up."
msgstr "放心。我会叫几个朋友来接你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000006
msgid "This is Miller."
msgstr "我是米勒。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000007
msgid "One for recovery. A civilian."
msgstr "回收一个。平民。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000008
msgid ""
"Snake, we don't have room for \n"
"any more civilians here."
msgstr ""
"SNAKE，我们这里没地方\n"
"再收平民了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000009
msgid "Not even for a blonde Parisienne?"
msgstr "金发巴黎女郎也不行？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000a
msgid "A what?! So she's, uh... pretty foxy?"
msgstr "一个什么？！这么说她，呃……挺性感的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000b
msgid ""
"See for yourself. If what she's saying is true,\n"
"I think we've found Paz's friend."
msgstr ""
"你自己看。若她说的是真的，\n"
"我们找到帕兹朋友了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000c
msgid "The missing one?"
msgstr "失踪那个？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000d
msgid "I'm thinking that she's the one that made that tape. "
msgstr "我觉得那盘磁带就是她录的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000e
msgid "Have her listen to it when she gets there."
msgstr "等她到了让她听听。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x00000f
msgid "So she's safe, then. Good news."
msgstr "那她安全了。好消息。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000010
msgid "I'm sure Paz will be glad to hear it."
msgstr "帕兹听到肯定高兴。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000011
msgid ""
"You bet. Snake, the ruins are just up ahead. \n"
"Head north."
msgstr ""
"当然。SNAKE，遗迹就在前面。\n"
"往北走。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xa27df6/0x000012
msgid "On my way."
msgstr "这就去。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xb27d78/0x000000
msgid "You're not... one of the soldiers? "
msgstr "你不是……士兵吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd0d/0xb27d78/0x000001
msgid "Please, lower your gun..."
msgstr "拜托，枪放下……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x227e34/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0x4282bf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0x4a8abf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0xb666bf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0xbe6ebf/0x000000
msgid "Don't move!"
msgstr "别动！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x227e34/0x000001
msgid ""
"\"Don't move\"... You men and your guns,\n"
"you all say the same thing."
msgstr ""
"\"别动\"……你们这些人拿着枪，\n"
"说的话都一样。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x227e57/0x000000
msgid "The Boss..."
msgstr "BOSS……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x227e57/0x000001
msgid "Well...?! What do you have to say for yourself?!"
msgstr "怎么……？！你还有什么好说的？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x227e57/0x000002
msgid "...she betrayed America. "
msgstr "……她背叛了美国。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x327df8/0x000000
msgid "What... "
msgstr "什么……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x327df8/0x000001
msgid "It can't be..."
msgstr "不可能……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000000
msgid "Looks like death wasn't ready for you yet."
msgstr "看来死神还没打算收你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000001
msgid "Boss...?!"
msgstr "BOSS……？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000002
msgid "And who might you be?"
msgstr "你又是谁？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000003
msgid "You..."
msgstr "你……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000004
msgid "Doctor... Strangelove, I presume."
msgstr "斯特兰奇洛夫博士吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000005
msgid "...I've been waiting, Snake."
msgstr "……我一直在等你，SNAKE。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000006
msgid "Yes, waiting without joy or pleasure..."
msgstr "没错，毫无喜悦地等着……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e1a/0x000007
msgid "Waiting for the one I despise!"
msgstr "等着我憎恨的那个人！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000000
msgid "I suppose you're here to destroy my research..."
msgstr "我猜你是来毁掉我的研究的……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000001
msgid ""
"Yes, I know. Just as I know \n"
"what you did 10 years ago."
msgstr ""
"是的，我知道。就像我知道\n"
"你10年前干了什么一样。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000002
msgid "Go on, kill me like you killed her."
msgstr "来吧，像杀她一样杀我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000003
msgid "Kill me like you killed The Boss."
msgstr "像杀THE BOSS一样杀了我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000004
msgid "Kill me!"
msgstr "杀了我！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e3b/0x000005
msgid "What exactly do you...?"
msgstr "你到底……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x427e58/0x000000
msgid ""
"She stole a Davy Crockett \n"
"and then defected to the other side."
msgstr ""
"她偷了一枚戴维·克罗克特\n"
"然后叛逃到了对面。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000000
msgid ""
"Her personal history, military records,\n"
"physiological data, correspondence, "
msgstr ""
"她的个人履历、军事记录、\n"
"生理数据、往来信件，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000001
msgid "the files for every operation she took part in."
msgstr "她参与过的每一次行动的档案。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000002
msgid ""
"Every decision she ever made at \n"
"every possible turn."
msgstr ""
"她在每个岔路口\n"
"做的每个决定。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000003
msgid "What she took, and what was taken from her."
msgstr "她夺走了什么，又被夺走了什么。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000004
msgid ""
"Her pain and her pleasure, her joy and sorrow,\n"
"her life and death."
msgstr ""
"她的痛苦与欢愉，喜悦与悲伤，\n"
"她的生与死。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000005
msgid "And yes, even you."
msgstr "没错，甚至包括你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000006
msgid "Wh...why would you do that?"
msgstr "为……为什么要那么做？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000007
msgid "Coldman sought an MAD based AI that would deliver an effective retaliatory strike "
msgstr "科尔德曼想要一种基于MAD的AI，能发动有效的报复打击，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000008
msgid ""
"against the most appropriate target \n"
"in response to a nuclear attack"
msgstr ""
"针对最合适的目标\n"
"以回应核攻击，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x000009
msgid "from a hypothetical adversary."
msgstr "来自假想敌的核攻击。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x4fd3ec/0x00000a
msgid ""
"An unmanned device to act as a deterrent,\n"
"capable of making the decisions"
msgstr ""
"一种无人装置充当威慑，\n"
"能够做出决策，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000000
msgid ""
"She used an American nuclear weapon \n"
"to attack Soviet territory."
msgstr ""
"她用美国的核武器\n"
"攻击了苏联领土。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000001
msgid ""
"The only way for Washington to prove\n"
"its innocence to Moscow... "
msgstr ""
"华盛顿向莫斯科证明\n"
"自身清白的唯一办法……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000002
msgid "was to eliminate the traitor themselves."
msgstr "就是亲手除掉叛徒。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000003
msgid "The Boss' death was the only thing that could have prevented all-out nuclear war."
msgstr "THE BOSS的死是唯一能阻止全面核战争的办法。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000004
msgid "Is that what you call the \"truth\"?"
msgstr "这就是你所谓“真相”？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000005
msgid "It's the truth as it was told to me."
msgstr "这是别人告诉我的真相。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000006
msgid ""
"So the truth is that you sullied \n"
"the reputation of your mentor, "
msgstr ""
"所以真相就是你玷污了\n"
"你导师的名誉，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000007
msgid ""
"the woman you loved most in this world,\n"
"before you buried her?"
msgstr ""
"那个你在这世上最爱的人，\n"
"然后才将她埋葬？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000008
msgid "...It was my mission."
msgstr "……那是我的任务。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x000009
msgid ""
"Hmph. So that's the conclusion you came to\n"
"in order to live with yourself."
msgstr ""
"哼。这就是你为了活下去\n"
"得出的结论。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x00000a
msgid "What's The Boss to you?"
msgstr "THE BOSS对你来说是什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x00000b
msgid ""
"I'm the one she abandoned \n"
"when she left this world."
msgstr ""
"我是她离开这个世界时\n"
"抛弃的人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x00000c
msgid ""
"I won't rest until I get answers \n"
"from the woman I loved. "
msgstr ""
"得不到我所爱之人的答案，\n"
"我绝不罢休。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527e5b/0x00000d
msgid "You and I are the same. We are the walking dead."
msgstr "你和我一样。我们都是行尸走肉。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000000
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000005
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000000
msgid "Boss...?"
msgstr "BOSS……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000001
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000003
msgid "Jack!"
msgstr "杰克！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000004
msgid "Go home! I'm not your Boss anymore!"
msgstr "回家！我不再是你BOSS了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x527ec1/0x000007
msgid "No, I..."
msgstr "不，我……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"This is my baby, my Morpho butterfly.\n"
"It's neither pupa nor cocoon, but an imago, "
msgstr ""
"这是我的宝贝，我的闪蝶。\n"
"它既非蛹也非茧，而是成虫，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000001
msgid ""
"a complete individual, \n"
"in the fullest sense of the word."
msgstr ""
"一个完整的个体，\n"
"名副其实的完整。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000002
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x000115
msgid "Is someone there?"
msgstr "有人吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000004
msgid "We have a visitor. I'll introduce him."
msgstr "有访客，我来引见。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000005
msgid "...Don't try anything foolish."
msgstr "……别耍花样。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x597e7d/0x000006
msgid "As long as we're in here, I can reduce you to carbon at the press of a button."
msgstr "只要在这里面，我按个按钮就能把你化成灰。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x6e8b94/0x000000
msgid "...Care for a sniff?"
msgstr "……要来一点吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x6e8b94/0x000001
msgid "It's only snuff. You're a cigar man, aren't you? "
msgstr "只是鼻烟。你是抽雪茄的吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x6e8b94/0x000002
msgid ""
"Well, there's no smoking in there,\n"
"so if you want to meet her,"
msgstr ""
"那里面不能抽烟，\n"
"所以你要是想见她，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x6e8b94/0x000003
msgid "you'd best partake now."
msgstr "最好现在就抽。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x6e8b94/0x000004
msgid "...Follow me."
msgstr "……跟我来。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000000
msgid "and taking the actions that human beings cannot."
msgstr "并采取人类无法采取的行动。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000001
msgid ""
"I therefore concluded he required a cool,\n"
"calculating machine "
msgstr ""
"所以我断定他需要一台冷静、\n"
"精算的机器，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000002
msgid ""
"programmed to inflict swift, sure,\n"
"and utter annihilation upon the enemy. "
msgstr ""
"被编程为对敌人施以迅速、可靠、\n"
"彻底的毁灭。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000003
msgid "No retaliation. "
msgstr "不予报复。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000004
msgid ""
"But he took it upon himself\n"
"to come up with a different answer."
msgstr ""
"但他却自作主张，\n"
"得出了不同的答案。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000005
msgid ""
"He said he needed the thought patterns of \n"
"the very finest rational mind, "
msgstr ""
"他说他需要最优秀的理性头脑的\n"
"思维模式，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000006
msgid "one that thought on a global scale, took both past and future into consideration,"
msgstr "一个以全球尺度思考、兼顾过去与未来，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000007
msgid ""
"and reached the best decision, \n"
"no matter how painful."
msgstr ""
"并做出最佳决断的人，\n"
"无论多么痛苦。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000008
msgid ""
"And that's why you asked for \n"
"everything they had on The Boss?"
msgstr ""
"所以你要了他们手上\n"
"关于THE BOSS的全部资料？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000009
msgid "It was the logical thing to do."
msgstr "这是合乎逻辑的做法。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000a
msgid ""
"I knew of only one person \n"
"who could be entrusted with the fate "
msgstr ""
"我只知道有一个人\n"
"可以被托付全人类的命运，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000b
msgid "of the entire human race."
msgstr "全人类的命运。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000c
msgid "What's your real goal here?"
msgstr "你真正的目的是什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000d
msgid "To clear her name."
msgstr "洗清她的名声。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000e
msgid ""
"Why was a legendary hero forced \n"
"to betray her country? "
msgstr ""
"传奇英雄为何被迫\n"
"背叛祖国？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x00000f
msgid ""
"Why was she targeted for assassination by you,\n"
"her most beloved disciple?"
msgstr ""
"为何你——她最心爱的弟子\n"
"要置她于死地？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000010
msgid "I have no use for fabrications..."
msgstr "我不需要编造的东西……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x727ea0/0x000011
msgid "I want the truth... The Boss' last will."
msgstr "我要真相……THE BOSS的遗志。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000000
msgid "Would you like to meet her?"
msgstr "你想见她吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000001
msgid "The Boss is gone."
msgstr "BOSS死了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000002
msgid "Not so fast!"
msgstr "别急！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000003
msgid ""
"You'd like to meet her, wouldn't you? \n"
"I can arrange it."
msgstr ""
"你想见她，对吧？\n"
"我可以安排。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000004
msgid "You took her life. I gave it back."
msgstr "你杀了她，我又救活。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e5e/0x000005
msgid "...You what?"
msgstr "……你说什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000000
msgid "A man..."
msgstr "一个男人……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000001
msgid "A war fighter..."
msgstr "战士……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000002
msgid "Boss? ...Is that you?"
msgstr "BOSS？是你吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000003
msgid "I call it the Mammal Pod."
msgstr "我叫它哺乳舱。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000004
msgid "Mammal Pod?"
msgstr "哺乳舱？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000005
msgid "For my participation on the project, "
msgstr "作为参与该项目的条件，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000006
msgid ""
"I demanded access to \n"
"all information on The Boss. "
msgstr ""
"我要求获取\n"
"THE BOSS的所有情报。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927e99/0x000007
msgid "Everything the CIA had."
msgstr "CIA掌握的一切。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0x927ec3/0x000000
msgid ""
"Complete your mission, Snake.\n"
"Extinguish that noble soul once again, if you can."
msgstr ""
"完成任务，SNAKE。\n"
"若你办得到，就再次熄灭那高贵的灵魂。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000000
msgid "You must be dying to know yourself."
msgstr "你一定也想知道吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000001
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a9
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000005
msgid "No..."
msgstr "不……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000002
msgid ""
"No. She abandoned her country... \n"
"abandoned us all."
msgstr ""
"不。她弃国……\n"
"弃了我们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000003
msgid "Really..."
msgstr "是吗……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000004
msgid "You think you understand her feelings?"
msgstr "你以为你懂她的感受？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000005
msgid ""
"You're trying to recreate The Boss' last will... \n"
"is that it?"
msgstr ""
"你想重现THE BOSS的遗志……\n"
"是这样吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000006
msgid "Why don't you ask her yourself... Jack?"
msgstr "你何不自己去问她……JACK？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000007
msgid "Jack...."
msgstr "JACK…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000008
msgid "What..?"
msgstr "什么……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xa27eba/0x000009
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00001a
msgid "Jack?"
msgstr "JACK？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000000
msgid "Come on, Snake! Or should I say, Big Boss? "
msgstr "来吧，SNAKE！还是该叫你BIG BOSS？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000001
msgid ""
"That filthy title given you as reward for murder...\n"
"Do you still wear it with pride?"
msgstr ""
"那个因杀戮而赏给你的肮脏头衔……\n"
"你还自豪地戴着它吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000002
msgid ""
"You chose a shadowy \"country\" over the mentor\n"
"who made you what you are. "
msgstr ""
"你选择了那个暗影中的\"国家\"，\n"
"背弃了造就你的恩师。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000003
msgid "You brought despair to good soldiers everywhere."
msgstr "你让各地优秀的士兵陷入绝望。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000004
msgid ""
"You used the pretext of a mission \n"
"to kill a true hero."
msgstr ""
"你借任务之名，\n"
"杀害了一位真正的英雄。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd2d/0xb27e3c/0x000005
msgid "Is that what you call loyalty? Answer me!"
msgstr "这就是你所谓忠诚？回答我！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x227eb4/0x000000
msgid "And that's the way a soldier's supposed to think?"
msgstr "士兵就该这么想吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x227eb4/0x000001
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000006
msgid ""
"The only thing we can believe in \n"
"with absolute certainty..."
msgstr ""
"我们唯一能绝对确信的\n"
"事情……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x227eb4/0x000002
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000007
msgid "...is the mission, Jack."
msgstr "……只有任务，JACK。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x327e72/0x000000
msgid "I taught you all I could."
msgstr "能教的都教了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x327e72/0x000001
msgid "The rest you needed to learn on your own."
msgstr "剩下的你得自己去学。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x327e72/0x000002
msgid ""
"Techniques, sure.\n"
"But what about how to think like a soldier?"
msgstr ""
"技术倒是学了。\n"
"可怎么像士兵一样思考呢？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x527e94/0x000000
msgid ""
"There's a saying in the Orient: \"Loyalty to \n"
"the end\"... Do you know what it means?"
msgstr ""
"东方有句话：\"尽忠到底\"……\n"
"你知道是什么意思吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x527e94/0x000001
msgid "Being... patriotic?"
msgstr "是……爱国？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x527e94/0x000002
msgid "It means devoting yourself to your country."
msgstr "意思是把自己献给国家。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x727eb9/0x000000
msgid "I'm defecting to the Soviet Union."
msgstr "我要叛逃去苏联。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x727eb9/0x000001
msgid "Jack, "
msgstr "JACK,"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0x727eb9/0x000002
msgid "you can't come with us."
msgstr "你不能跟我们走"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0xb27e9a/0x000000
msgid ""
"As long as we have \"loyalty to the end,\" \n"
"there's no point in believing in anything..."
msgstr ""
"只要还有\"尽忠到底\"，\n"
"信仰任何东西都毫无意义……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd4d/0xb27e9a/0x000001
msgid "even in those we love."
msgstr "连所爱之人也一样。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000000
msgid "How's the horse doing?"
msgstr "马怎么样了？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000001
msgid ""
"Not too bad. You'd never know \n"
"he was over 20 years old."
msgstr ""
"还不赖。看不出\n"
"他已经20多岁了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000002
msgid "He was hers, after all."
msgstr "毕竟他是她的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000003
msgid "Seems like some part of her became a part of him."
msgstr "似乎她的一部分成了他的一部分。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000004
msgid "The platform and the cerebral AI"
msgstr "平台和大脑AI"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x327ef1/0x000005
msgid ""
"are supposed to be assembled at \n"
"an underground base disguised as a mine."
msgstr ""
"应该是在伪装成矿坑的\n"
"地下基地组装。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000000
msgid "If my guess is right, "
msgstr "如果我猜得没错，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000001
msgid ""
"both of them have already arrived \n"
"and are being readied for final testing."
msgstr ""
"两者都已运抵，\n"
"正在为最终测试做准备。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000002
msgid "Destroying the platform will be difficult. "
msgstr "摧毁平台会很困难。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000003
msgid ""
"I suggest getting up close \n"
"and destroying the AI instead."
msgstr ""
"我建议靠近\n"
"摧毁AI。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000004
msgid "Whatever you do, I'm begging you, "
msgstr "无论如何，我求你，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afd6d/0x727f0f/0x000005
msgid ""
"don't let my Peace Walker launch a nuke.\n"
"Hurry, Snake!"
msgstr ""
"别让我的和平行者发射核弹。\n"
"快，SNAKE！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000000
msgid "That supposed to be an offer?"
msgstr "这算是提议吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000001
msgid "I'm not offering anything."
msgstr "我什么都没提议。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000002
msgid ""
"If I'm to sell my new system, \n"
"you and yours have got to go."
msgstr ""
"要卖我的新系统，\n"
"你和你的人就得消失。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000003
msgid "Wait! Coldman, I have questions for him"
msgstr "等等！科尔德曼，我还有话问他"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000004
msgid ""
"information critical to the completion\n"
"of the Mammal Pod."
msgstr ""
"关于完成哺乳舱的\n"
"关键情报。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000005
msgid "Give him to me."
msgstr "把他交给我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000006
msgid "Hmph... Don't waste too much time."
msgstr "哼……别浪费太多时间。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000007
msgid ""
"We've just received word that \n"
"the SALT-II talks are on schedule."
msgstr ""
"刚收到消息，\n"
"SALT-II会谈如期进行。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000008
msgid "We will launch on time."
msgstr "我们将按时发射。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x000009
msgid "Snake, you are going to help me resurrect her."
msgstr "SNAKE，你要帮我让她复活。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x228158/0x00000a
msgid "Shut up! The Boss is dead!"
msgstr "闭嘴！BOSS死了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000000
msgid "Initiate."
msgstr "启动。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000001
msgid "What's the situation?"
msgstr "情况如何？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000002
msgid ""
"We're waiting on acknowledgement from Reptile.\n"
"It could be a while."
msgstr ""
"我们在等Reptile确认。\n"
"可能要等一阵。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000003
msgid "Don't take all night."
msgstr "别磨蹭一整晚。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000004
msgid "Oh, Coldman, I'd like to perform one final check."
msgstr "科尔德曼，我想做最后一次检查。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000005
msgid "Everyone, take a break."
msgstr "各位，歇会儿。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000006
msgid ""
"I've got some concerns about \n"
"the dummy data for Mammal..."
msgstr ""
"我对Mammal的\n"
"假数据有些担心……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x4280f6/0x000007
msgid "Now's your chance, Snake."
msgstr "机会来了，SNAKE。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000000
msgid ""
"Mammal showed the same \n"
"response back at the lab."
msgstr ""
"Mammal在实验室里\n"
"也是同样的反应。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000001
msgid "It's a sure sign that you are nearby."
msgstr "这明确说明你就在附近。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000002
msgid "It's an honor to meet you again, Big Boss."
msgstr "很荣幸再次见到你，BIG BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000003
msgid "I've seen that coyote before."
msgstr "那只郊狼我见过。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000004
msgid "Lobo is the name."
msgstr "它叫Lobo。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x428114/0x000005
msgid "Lobo? Smells like a rotting corpse to me."
msgstr "Lobo？我只闻到腐尸味。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000000
msgid "No, machines don't make mistakes. Only men do."
msgstr "不，机器不会犯错。只有人会。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000001
msgid "That's why a fully automated, mechanized deterrent like Peace Walker is needed."
msgstr "所以才需要和平行者这种全自动机械化威慑力量。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000002
msgid ""
"Once our system is embraced, Langley will again\n"
"turn its attention to Latin America"
msgstr ""
"一旦我们的系统被采纳，兰利将再次\n"
"把目光转向拉丁美洲"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000003
msgid "as the cockpit of the new Cold War."
msgstr "视其为新冷战角斗场。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000004
msgid "Honduras, Nicaragua, Costa Rica, Panama..."
msgstr "洪都拉斯、尼加拉瓜、哥斯达黎加、巴拿马……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000005
msgid ""
"Peace Walker will be deployed along \n"
"Central America's entire Caribbean coast."
msgstr ""
"和平行者将部署在中美洲\n"
"整个加勒比沿岸。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000006
msgid ""
"All of North America, South America,\n"
"and the West Indies will be within its range."
msgstr ""
"整个北美、南美\n"
"以及西印度群岛都将在其射程内。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000007
msgid "We'll bring law and order to the entire continent."
msgstr "我们将为整个大陆带来法律与秩序。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000008
msgid "And you'll still be calling the shots."
msgstr "而发号施令的仍然是你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x000009
msgid "Hmph. ...You still don't get it."
msgstr "哼。……你还是不懂。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000a
msgid ""
"The age of heroes is over, buried alongside\n"
"The Boss and her bankrupt beliefs."
msgstr ""
"英雄时代已结束，与THE BOSS\n"
"和她破产的信念同葬。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000b
msgid "From now on, our only heroes will be machines."
msgstr "今后，我们唯一英雄是机器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000c
msgid "Surely no one understands that better than you?"
msgstr "想必没人比你更清楚这一点吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000d
msgid "Except perhaps your partner."
msgstr "也许除了你的搭档。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000e
msgid "A deterrent for hire. An army without borders."
msgstr "受雇的威慑。一支无国界军队。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x52813c/0x00000f
msgid ""
"You've invented a new system, too,\n"
"and an admirable one at that."
msgstr ""
"你也发明了一套新体系，\n"
"而且令人钦佩。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000000
msgid ""
"I know all about you. \n"
"Tselinoyarsk? Ten years ago?"
msgstr ""
"我对你了如指掌。\n"
"捷列诺亚尔斯克？十年前？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000001
msgid "You were involved...?"
msgstr "你也参与了……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000002
msgid ""
"The operation to eliminate the traitor?\n"
"I planned the whole thing."
msgstr ""
"消灭叛徒的行动？\n"
"整个计划都是我制定的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000003
msgid "Shouldn't a suit like you be back at Langley?"
msgstr "你这种身份的人不该回兰利吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000004
msgid "What the hell are you doing here?"
msgstr "你到底来这里干什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000005
msgid "...It's what the CIA does best."
msgstr "……CIA最擅长这个。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000006
msgid ""
"Ensure people in the know keep \n"
"their mouths shut,"
msgstr ""
"确保知情者守口如瓶，\n"
"保持沉默，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000007
msgid ""
"or else pack them off someplace \n"
"where there's no one to listen."
msgstr ""
"否则就把他们打发到\n"
"没人听得到的地方。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000008
msgid ""
"I get it. Trying to claw \n"
"your way back into their good graces... "
msgstr ""
"我明白了。想方设法\n"
"重新讨他们的欢心……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000009
msgid "It's not quite that simple."
msgstr "没那么简单。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000a
msgid "My aim is... a new world order."
msgstr "我的目标是……一种新的世界秩序。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000b
msgid ""
"Détente, \n"
"the NPT (Nuclear Non-Proliferation Treaty),"
msgstr ""
"缓和政策、\n"
"NPT（核不扩散条约）、"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000c
msgid ""
"SALT (Strategic Arms Limitation Talks),\n"
"TTBT (Threshold Test Ban Treaty)..."
msgstr ""
"SALT（战略武器限制谈判）、\n"
"TTBT（限核试验条约）……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000d
msgid "Ever since the Cuban Missile Crisis,"
msgstr "自古巴导弹危机以来，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000e
msgid ""
"the structure of the Cold War has been\n"
"coming apart at the seams."
msgstr ""
"冷战的结构一直在\n"
"分崩离析。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x00000f
msgid "A new age is dawning."
msgstr "一个新时代正在来临。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000010
msgid "An age in which Peace Walker,"
msgstr "在这个时代，和平行者，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000011
msgid ""
"an infallible nuclear deterrent system\n"
"with the patience and cold logic of a machine,"
msgstr ""
"一套万无一失的核威慑系统，\n"
"拥有机器的耐心与冷酷逻辑，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000012
msgid "will play a vital role."
msgstr "将发挥至关重要的作用。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000013
msgid ""
"That's your plan? Assigning \n"
"humanity's sins to a bunch of machines?"
msgstr ""
"这就是你的计划？把\n"
"人类的罪孽交给一堆机器？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x628118/0x000014
msgid "Hmph. Quite the romantic."
msgstr "哼。真浪漫。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0x62815b/0x000000
msgid "Bring him."
msgstr "带他上来。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000000
msgid ""
"Remember the Cuban Missile Crisis,\n"
"when the commander of a Russian sub"
msgstr ""
"记得古巴导弹危机吗，\n"
"当时俄潜艇指挥官"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000001
msgid "refused an order to launch a nuclear-armed torpedo at an American destroyer?"
msgstr "拒绝了向美国驱逐舰发射核鱼雷的命令？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000002
msgid ""
"In retrospect, that man was a hero.\n"
"He saved the world from all-out nuclear war."
msgstr ""
"回想起来，那男人是英雄。\n"
"他阻止核战，拯救世界。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000003
msgid "Humans are incapable of destroying themselves."
msgstr "人类无法毁灭自己。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000004
msgid "...But an AI wouldn't hesitate to push the button."
msgstr "……但AI会毫不犹豫地按下按钮。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000005
msgid "Precisely. Making it the one real deterrent."
msgstr "正是。它是唯一真正威慑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000006
msgid "People hesitate, lose their nerve."
msgstr "人会犹豫，会丧失勇气。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xa28133/0x000007
msgid ""
"Isn't that why deterrence theory \n"
"works in the first place?"
msgstr ""
"这不正是威慑理论\n"
"能够成立的原因吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000000
msgid "...Jack, you've returned."
msgstr "……杰克，你回来了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000001
msgid "What's wrong? Your body temperature has fallen."
msgstr "怎么了？你的体温下降了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000002
msgid "... You're imagining things."
msgstr "……你想多了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000003
msgid "Have you come to destroy me?"
msgstr "你是来毁灭我的吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000004
msgid "Your pulse has quickened slightly."
msgstr "你的脉搏略微加快了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000005
msgid "Just chilly. It's freezing in here."
msgstr "只是冷。这里冻死了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000006
msgid "...I see."
msgstr "……原来如此。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000008
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000b
msgid "What is it, Jack?"
msgstr "怎么了，杰克？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000009
msgid "Boss?"
msgstr "BOSS？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000a
msgid "Is that you?"
msgstr "是你吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000c
msgid "Do you have..."
msgstr "你有……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000d
msgid "regrets?"
msgstr "后悔过？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000e
msgid "Regrets?"
msgstr "后悔？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00000f
msgid "About your final mission."
msgstr "关于最后任务。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000010
msgid "My final mission?"
msgstr "最后任务？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000011
msgid "The one in Groznyj Grad."
msgstr "格罗兹尼格勒那次。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000012
msgid "I've... never been on a mission there."
msgstr "我……没在那执行过任务。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000013
msgid "September, 1964... "
msgstr "1964年9月……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000014
msgid "You betrayed the United States... and then..."
msgstr "你背叛了美国……然后……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000015
msgid "I killed you."
msgstr "我杀了你"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000016
msgid "I have no record of such a debriefing."
msgstr "我没有那次汇报的记录。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000017
msgid "...Listen to me!"
msgstr "……听我说"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000018
msgid ""
"I have to know, did you defect to \n"
"the Soviet Union of your own free will?"
msgstr ""
"我必须知道，你是自愿\n"
"叛逃到苏联的吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x000019
msgid ""
"There is no mission record \n"
"matching that description."
msgstr ""
"没有与描述相符的\n"
"任务记录。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00001b
msgid "You're not The Boss. The Boss is dead!"
msgstr "你不是THE BOSS。THE BOSS死了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00001c
msgid "Don't do it, Jack."
msgstr "别动手，杰克。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afded/0xb28110/0x00001d
msgid "Drop your weapon, Big Boss."
msgstr "放下武器，BIG BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe0d/0x4281da/0x000001
msgid "Take him away."
msgstr "把他带走"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000000
msgid "I didn't defect."
msgstr "我没叛逃"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000001
msgid "I'm loyal... to the end, to my purpose."
msgstr "我忠诚……至死，忠于我的使命。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000002
msgid "What about you, Jack?"
msgstr "那你呢，杰克？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000003
msgid ""
"What's it going to be? \n"
"Loyalty to your country or loyalty to me?"
msgstr ""
"你要选哪边？\n"
"忠于你的国家，还是忠于我？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000004
msgid ""
"Your country, or your old mentor?\n"
"Your mission, or your beliefs?"
msgstr ""
"你的国家，还是恩师？\n"
"你的任务，还是信念？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x3281f2/0x000005
msgid "Your duty to your unit, or your personal feelings?"
msgstr "对部队的职责，还是个人感情？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x328213/0x000000
msgid ""
"...You hate me? Fine. Turn it up.\n"
"It doesn't change the fact that I killed her!"
msgstr ""
"……你恨我？行。再大声点。\n"
"这改变不了我杀了她的事实！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x328213/0x000001
msgid ""
"I know that... \n"
"But what I don't know is your motive."
msgstr ""
"我知道……\n"
"但我不知道你的动机。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x328213/0x000002
msgid ""
"Why would a hero - loyal to the end -\n"
"betray her country?!"
msgstr ""
"至死忠诚的英雄，\n"
"为何背叛她的国家？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x328213/0x000003
msgid "What really happened?! What did you see?!"
msgstr "到底发生了什么？！你看到了什么？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x328213/0x000004
msgid ""
"...She betrayed more than just her country.\n"
"She betrayed me, too."
msgstr ""
"……她背叛的不只是她的国家。\n"
"她也背叛了我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000000
msgid ""
"Your Boss defected from the U.S.\n"
"taking a Davy Crockett with her, "
msgstr ""
"你的BOSS从美国叛逃，\n"
"带走一枚戴维·克罗克特，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000001
msgid ""
"and used it to launch a nuclear \n"
"strike on Soviet territory. "
msgstr ""
"并用它对苏联领土\n"
"发动了核打击。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000002
msgid ""
"That much I know from \n"
"the CIA's official debriefing."
msgstr ""
"这些是我从CIA的\n"
"官方汇报中得知的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000003
msgid "...Did she defect or not?"
msgstr "……她到底有没有叛逃？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000004
msgid ""
"Answer me! Did she or did she not die \n"
"for her country?"
msgstr ""
"回答我！她到底有没有\n"
"为国捐躯？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000005
msgid ""
"...She sold us out. \n"
"My orders were to take care of her."
msgstr ""
"……她出卖了我们。\n"
"命令是处理掉她。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000006
msgid "Liar! I want to know the truth!"
msgstr "骗子！我要知道真相！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x503f54/0x000007
msgid "Brace yourself."
msgstr "站稳了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x504352/0x000000
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000007
msgid "Answer me!"
msgstr "回答！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000000
msgid "Then how do you explain that bandana?"
msgstr "那这条头巾你怎么解释？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000001
msgid "Why keep a memento of a traitor...?"
msgstr "为什么留叛徒遗物……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000002
msgid "...What are you talking about...?"
msgstr "……你在说什么……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000003
msgid "And what about that scar?!"
msgstr "那这道伤疤呢？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000004
msgid ""
"Don't tell me you have the same scars\n"
"by sheer coincidence!"
msgstr ""
"别告诉我你身上的伤疤\n"
"只是巧合！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000005
msgid "DON'T touch me!"
msgstr "别碰我！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000006
msgid "Decorating your body with her memory..."
msgstr "用她记忆装饰身体……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528216/0x000007
msgid "Rather effeminate if you ask me."
msgstr "要我说，挺娘娘腔。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000000
msgid ""
"Would you see your beloved Boss \n"
"brought back to life?!"
msgstr ""
"你想让你敬爱的BOSS\n"
"复活吗？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000001
msgid "Then say it. Say she died for America!"
msgstr "那就说啊。说她是为美国而死！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000002
msgid "That she remained true to the end, "
msgstr "说她至死不渝，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000003
msgid ""
"gave her life for the country that \n"
"betrayed her time and again!"
msgstr ""
"为那个一次次背叛她的国家\n"
"献出了生命！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000004
msgid "...No..."
msgstr "……不……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000005
msgid "...That woman..."
msgstr "……那个女人……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x528237/0x000006
msgid "...was a traitor!"
msgstr "……是个叛徒！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0000b7
msgid "Rise and shine."
msgstr "起床了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000001
msgid ""
"Coldman's greed does not concern me.\n"
"I'm only interested in one thing."
msgstr ""
"科尔德曼的贪婪与我无关。\n"
"我只对一件事感兴趣。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000002
msgid "The truth."
msgstr "真相。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000003
msgid ""
"I'm a scientist - an AI developer. \n"
"But not an AI myself."
msgstr ""
"我是科学家，AI开发者。\n"
"但我不是AI。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000004
msgid ""
"I'm a scientist. And as a scientist, \n"
"I find this distasteful."
msgstr ""
"我是科学家。作为科学家，\n"
"我觉得这很恶心。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000005
msgid ""
"You understand? I am a scientist \n"
"and I expect answers that make sense."
msgstr ""
"你明白吗？我是科学家，\n"
"我要的是合理的答案。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x6281f5/0x000006
msgid "Now, what do you know?"
msgstr "你知道什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000000
msgid "Why... For what purpose...?"
msgstr "为什么……为了什么目的……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000001
msgid "...She went to her grave cursing her country."
msgstr "……她诅咒国家进了坟墓。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000002
msgid "Why?! Who is it?! What are you protecting?!"
msgstr "为什么？！是谁？！你在保护什么？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000003
msgid "I'm not helping you finish that thing!"
msgstr "我不会帮你完成那东西！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000004
msgid ""
"Face it! The Boss is dead! Whatever's\n"
"inside that machine, it isn't her!"
msgstr ""
"面对现实！THE BOSS死了！那机器里\n"
"装的不是她！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0x72823a/0x000005
msgid ""
"I'm raising the voltage. \n"
"The next one might kill you."
msgstr ""
"我要升压了。\n"
"下一发可能会要你的命。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000000
msgid ""
"Admit it! She sacrificed her life for America,\n"
"didn't she?!"
msgstr ""
"承认吧！她为美国牺牲了性命，\n"
"不是吗？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000001
msgid ""
"Sacrificed all for a country that cared nothing\n"
"for her soul or for her dignity. "
msgstr ""
"为一个毫不在乎她灵魂与尊严的\n"
"国家牺牲了一切。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000002
msgid "And you...!"
msgstr "还有你……！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000003
msgid ""
"Yes, I do hate you.\n"
"But even you must understand how I feel. "
msgstr ""
"没错，我恨你。\n"
"但你也该明白我感受。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000004
msgid "I have a right to know what she died for!"
msgstr "我有权知道她为何而死！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000005
msgid ""
"Why won't you tell me?\n"
"You're no longer one of Washington's lapdogs. "
msgstr ""
"你为什么不肯说？\n"
"你已不再是华盛顿的走狗了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28233/0x000006
msgid "You have no moral obligation to your country."
msgstr "你对国家没有道义上的义务。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28254/0x000000
msgid "Why... Why not just give up...?"
msgstr "为什么……为什么不干脆放弃……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xb28254/0x000001
msgid "He's passed out..."
msgstr "他昏过去了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xe2325e/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x10325f/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x10825f/0x000000
msgid "A power failure? Damn it... discontinue."
msgstr "停电？该死……中止。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003afe2d/0xe23e5e/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x103e5f/0x000000
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x108e5f/0x000000
msgid "Something's going on outside."
msgstr "外面出事了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000000
msgid "...kill me..."
msgstr "……杀了我……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000001
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x00003f
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000010
msgid "Stop it!"
msgstr "住手！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000002
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000004
msgid "kill me..."
msgstr "杀了我……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000003
msgid "Shut up!"
msgstr "闭嘴！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x0f4590/0x000005
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0001a5
msgid "SHUT UP!"
msgstr "闭嘴！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x228d93/0x000000
msgid "...You..."
msgstr "……你……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x228d93/0x000001
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x328da8/0x000001
msgid "...Take him away."
msgstr "……把他带走。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x51ae48/0x000000
msgid "Ready to talk now?"
msgstr "现在肯说？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x51ae48/0x000001
msgid "I've got nothing to say to you."
msgstr "我跟你没什么好说的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x51ae48/0x000002
msgid "I think you do."
msgstr "我看你有。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x51ae48/0x000003
msgid "Very well, then."
msgstr "那好吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x528d74/0x000000
msgid "...Kill me."
msgstr "……杀了我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x528d74/0x000001
msgid "I don't care."
msgstr "我不管。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x528d74/0x000002
msgid "I killed her."
msgstr "是我杀了她。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x528d74/0x000003
msgid "...No, that is not what I want to know."
msgstr "……不，我想知道的不是这个。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x828d76/0x000000
msgid "...Do it... "
msgstr "……动手吧……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x828d76/0x000001
msgid "kill me... "
msgstr "杀了我……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x828d76/0x000002
msgid "kill me now..."
msgstr "现在就杀了我……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b010d/0x828d76/0x000003
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x00000d
msgid "Stop it..."
msgstr "住手……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x0f95f0/0x000000
msgid "...She... she betrayed her country."
msgstr "……她……她叛国了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x0f95f0/0x000001
msgid "Liar! She's NOT a traitor!"
msgstr "骗子！她不是叛徒！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x328da8/0x000000
msgid "...I don't understand it..."
msgstr "……我不明白……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b0c8/0x000000
msgid "Now, let's have it. The truth."
msgstr "好了，说吧。真相。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b0c8/0x000001
msgid "I've said all I'm gonna say."
msgstr "我要说的都说了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b0c8/0x000002
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr "是吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b14e/0x000000
msgid "No, I don't hate you anymore."
msgstr "不，我不再恨你了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b14e/0x000001
msgid "Do it... kill me... I killed her..."
msgstr "动手……杀了我……是我杀了她……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b14e/0x000002
msgid "Please, stop... stop it..."
msgstr "求你了，住手……住手……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b14e/0x000003
msgid "I killed her... my beloved... with my own hands..."
msgstr "我杀了她……我心爱的……亲手……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0112/0x51b14e/0x000004
msgid "Stop it! That's not what happened! You're lying!"
msgstr "住手！事情不是那样的！你在撒谎！"
